    "created_at": "2016-04-12T00:46:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-12T00:46:52Z",
    "body": "> @mnoorenberghe for that UI it seems developers should migrate towards https://w3c.github.io/permissions/ which supports changes. I don't think we should try to retrofit legacy permission APIs for that use case.\n\nI filed w3c/permissions/issues/76 as it's not clear to me that the new API actually supports the current Fx UI while being able to notify developers about \"minimized\" requests.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
