    "created_at": "2016-04-12T07:36:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-12T07:36:30Z",
    "body": "@mnoorenberghe the callback just exists for backwards compatibility. I don't think we should diverge it from the promise-based API we've been encouraging folks to switch to. That'd just make a mess of things and does not match what is already shipping in Chrome for this setup.\n\nIt does seem somewhat sad if the permission API was solely influenced by Google UX. Hope that's not the case.\n",
